        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion S1, Renwood Standard Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFusion hardware's New Traditional Handleset is exactly that, a blend of contemporary and old world designs. The oval shape of the Renwood Handleset along with the ridged grip are traditional in style while its sleekness makes it relevant to today's decors. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. It will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Renwood Solid Brass Handleset Fusion S1:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion S1 New Traditional Door Entry Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 17\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Widest Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The finish for the inside knob or lever you choose will match the outside finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Renwood New Traditional Handleset, Fusion S1",
                "description": "Renwood Standard Handleset Fusion S1 - Fusion hardware's New Traditional Handleset is exactly that, a blend of contemporary and old world designs. The oval shape of the Renwood Handleset along with the ridged grip are traditional in style while its sleekness makes it relevant to today's decors. It is available in brushed nickel, oil rubbed bronze, and lifetime polished brass finishes. It will fit standard 5-1/2 inch on center door boring.",
